msgstr "用 `parse_tof_gid` 一次性解析 gid 的所有字段："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:78 824190ffd3c94efa87017c4a5a81d29b
msgid ""
"When the input is an `ak.Array`, the result is also an `ak.Array` with "
"record fields."
msgstr "当输入为 `ak.Array` 时，结果也是带 record 字段的 `ak.Array`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:80 07b8f55990e744e2b5bbc2ac15de9b14
