msgstr "闪烁体 / MRPC 位置"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:82 1b8c75d73d8c41428b667fcbc1a0f3a6
msgid ""
"Each strip (scintillator or MRPC) has 8 vertices. `tof_gid_to_point_*` "
"take two arguments (`gid` and `point`), both support scalar/array inputs "
"independently:"
msgstr ""
"每个 strip（闪烁体或 MRPC）有 8 个顶点。`tof_gid_to_point_*` 接受两个参数（`gid` 与 "
"`point`），两者都独立支持标量/数组输入："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:140 077bc21b91a142678170496e634f4442
msgid "Retrieve the full strip position table:"
msgstr "获取完整的 strip 位置表："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:153 bc8ebf42f6b3429b92dca54103f85106
msgid "Hit status"
msgstr "hit 状态字"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:155 ff378c55161a4656a9b9d77ea0f7f5f7
msgid ""
"The hit status of a TOF hit encodes which part of the TOF the hit belongs"
" to, its layer, and several flags and counters of the hit. It can be "
"parsed into individual fields, and it can also be combined with the "
"`tofID` of the hit to get the `gid` of the hit strip."
msgstr ""
"TOF hit 的状态字编码了该 hit 属于 TOF 的哪一部分、所在层，以及若干标志位与计数器。它既可以被解析成各个字段，也可以与 hit 的"
" `tofID` 结合得到该 strip 的 `gid`。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:159 a9e883139b43430495a064fd3bc37494
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:161 a1c286c96502458e836504f5c26231db
msgid ""
"Pybes3 provides implementation of `TofHitStatus` functions. They are "
"defined as `tof_hit_status_to_*`. All these functions are backed by "
"compiled NumPy ufuncs. The calling convention is identical for scalar, "
"NumPy array, and Awkward Array inputs:"
msgstr ""
"Pybes3 提供了 `TofHitStatus` 各函数的实现，命名统一为 `tof_hit_status_to_*`。这些函数都由编译好的 "
"NumPy ufunc 实现，标量、NumPy 数组与 Awkward Array 三种输入的调用方式完全一致："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:238 4ffa41496c46403d85634077a2ac1cbd
msgid "Use `parse_tof_hit_status` to parse all fields from a hit status at once:"
msgstr "用 `parse_tof_hit_status` 一次性解析状态字的所有字段："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:257 d8e2465a36044618927332b3949e035b
msgid "Strip gid"
msgstr "strip 的 gid"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:259 45157c6336df42ccabe0f93fa9ffc927
msgid ""
"`tof_hit_status_id_to_gid` converts the hit status and the `tofID` of a "
"TOF hit into the `gid` of the strip which was hit:"
msgstr "`tof_hit_status_id_to_gid` 把 TOF hit 的状态字与其 `tofID` 转换成被击中 strip 的 `gid`："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:274 a2992f43769043dea596e0e9ca59ad76
msgid ""
"The `tofID` is not the raw digi ID, but a compact index which enumerates "
"the counters of the part of the TOF the hit belongs to. The two endcaps "
"of a sub-detector share a single index space, the east one first, and the"
" hit status tells which sub-detector it is:"
msgstr ""
"`tofID` 不是原始 digi ID，而是一个紧凑索引，按该 hit 所属 TOF "
"部位的各计数器顺序编号。子探测器的两个端盖共用一个索引空间（东端盖在前），由状态字指明它属于哪个子探测器："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 fc0b1274599b453c804043bd43995848
msgid "Part"
msgstr "部位"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 86e46b724c8e4af7968ccd626199e49a
#: 8feb46c5f77e424d948e119d06353152
msgid "`tofID`"
msgstr "`tofID`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 081dc61d955e4dff8f8c13db2340ca22
msgid "`gid`"
msgstr "`gid`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 9f1f1c418b0f4793bd8dae2bae228fe8
msgid "Barrel"
msgstr "桶部"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 a79f4a21c5914e39a37021a65efbaa96
msgid "`layer * 88 + phi`"
msgstr "`layer * 88 + phi`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 20266d8d790d429d9aaa8b62d418971f
msgid "`48 + tofID`"
msgstr "`48 + tofID`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 ae8184a4a7474af6901c8600ac3a687d
msgid "Scintillator east endcap"
msgstr "闪烁体东端盖"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 621dd8784d4c4aa8bc44ba30ef8d137c
msgid "`phi`"
msgstr "`phi`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 f28a5ecf63e046dbae3e3a26d65a3038
msgid "Scintillator west endcap"
msgstr "闪烁体西端盖"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 5fce47923f4b4231809d3ef74f45ba2f
msgid "`48 + phi`"
msgstr "`48 + phi`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 82717021e8924414911b9354a32d7142
msgid "`tofID + 176`"
msgstr "`tofID + 176`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 26a1295759a94e6c9ed5dd1ccf5b9412
msgid "MRPC east endcap"
msgstr "MRPC 东端盖"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 f1b9fc2a81c64b3aaab8b4f105169047
msgid "`module * 12 + strip`"
msgstr "`module * 12 + strip`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 2053e36ca00b496f9f64ceca72cb4262
#: e224c79864084c2ab3fa0e944101b673
msgid "`272 + tofID`"
msgstr "`272 + tofID`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 5614456e04804c65acde906ca6a60dfc
msgid "MRPC west endcap"
msgstr "MRPC 西端盖"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:213 c85ebf93ce2e469ab8753b9a5a05563e
msgid "`432 + module * 12 + strip`"
msgstr "`432 + module * 12 + strip`"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:287 c6094a78635c4525ad44dc52e7b503df
msgid ""
"A hit without a hit status (`status == 0`) stores the raw digi ID in "
"`m_tofID` instead of the compact index above, and a negative `m_tofID` is"
" not a valid counter index. Both are rejected with a `ValueError`, so "
"filter them out before calling the function."
msgstr ""
"没有状态字（`status == 0`）的 hit 会在 `m_tofID` 中存放原始 digi ID而不是上面的紧凑索引，负的 "
"`m_tofID` 也不是有效的计数器索引。这两种情况都会抛出 `ValueError`，请在调用前先过滤掉。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:292 730f4d08b09b48dba506c1bb84b78f5a
msgid "Raw data conversion"
msgstr "原始数据转换"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:294 dfc7136bbf9349198c3676ad9b8e1ace
msgid ""
"The ADC and the TDC channel numbers of a hit can be converted into charge"
" and time with `tof_adc_to_charge` and `tof_tdc_to_time`:"
msgstr "hit 的 ADC 与 TDC 道数可用 `tof_adc_to_charge` 与 `tof_tdc_to_time` 分别转换为电荷与时间："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:308 37d34ec52a1e4a5abf1ef49c587fe740
msgid ""
"The charge is calculated as `charge = (adc & 0x1fff) * 0.3`, i.e. only "
"the lower 13 bits of the ADC word carry the charge channel number, and "
"the conversion formula of the time is:"
msgstr "电荷按 `charge = (adc & 0x1fff) * 0.3` 计算，即只有 ADC 字的低 13 位携带电荷道数；时间的换算公式为："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:312 cf8816d7617c4f4e9378d923aef193b1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times \\frac{12000}{499.8 \\times 8 \\times "
"1024}~\\mathrm{ns}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\text{time} = \\text{tdc} \\times \\frac{12000}{499.8 \\times 8 \\times "
"1024}~\\mathrm{ns}\n"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:316 dfe762907f704cbdae0cb1b9df0017d7
msgid "Same as BOSS"
msgstr "与 BOSS 一致"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/tof.md:319 698130a77e174e809ab47e2dd1c7f8ac
msgid ""
"TOF charge and time calculations are the same as the ones given by "
"`RawDataUtil::TofCharge` and `RawDataUtil::TofTime` in BOSS."
msgstr ""
"TOF 的电荷与时间计算与 BOSS 中 `RawDataUtil::TofCharge` 和 `RawDataUtil::TofTime` "
"给出的结果一致。"

